{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.band_mul_bandInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.band_mul_bandInv","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L97-L104","doc":"`band · bandInv = 1`: the band is invertible with the stated inverse (uses `e² = [2]e`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.bandInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.bandInv","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L93-L95","doc":"The inverse band `q⁻²·1 + h·e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.band","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.band","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L89-L91","doc":"The band generator `σ² = A_{i,i+1} = q²·1 − h·e`, with `h = q − 1/q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptr_mu_eTL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptr_mu_eTL","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L81-L87","doc":"With the *other* weight μ = diag(q, 1/q), the contraction is `diag(q⁻², q²)`, NOT the identity —\nthe reason the proof must use μ⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptr_muInv_eTL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptr_muInv_eTL","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L74-L79","doc":"**The cap-cup sub-lemma with the correct weight μ⁻¹ = diag(1/q, q): `ptr_{μ⁻¹}(e) = 1`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL_mul_eTL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL_mul_eTL","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L66-L72","doc":"The defining TL relation: `e² = [2]·e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL_eq","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L60-L64","doc":"`e = q•1 − R`: the TL generator is `q` minus the R-matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptrLast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.ptrLast","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L54-L58","doc":"Partial trace over the **second** tensor factor with a diagonal weight `diag(w0, w1)`:\n`(ptr X)_{a,b} = w0·X_{2a,2b} + w1·X_{2a+1,2b+1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.twoQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.twoQ","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L51-L52","doc":"The quantum integer `[2] = q + 1/q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.eTL","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L44-L49","doc":"The Temperley–Lieb generator `e` on `V ⊗ V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.Rmat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.Rmat","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TemperleyLiebSpinHalf.lean#L37-L42","doc":"The Hecke R-matrix on `V ⊗ V` (spin-½), eigenvalues `q` and `−1/q`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}